    - target: {fileID: 4226645283735207914, guid: 2d67ff070cfe97d41b6e346dc9822847, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[19]'
      value: 'I heard the teachers have a key for all of the classroom doors. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4226645283735207914, guid: 2d67ff070cfe97d41b6e346dc9822847, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[20]'
      value: My friend in dance class said they saw the door code.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4226645283735207914, guid: 2d67ff070cfe97d41b6e346dc9822847, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[21]'
      value: "Those foil weirdos are obsessed with turning off the dance class\u2019
