PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 744393671343501504, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: MALE_TEACHER_VAR_NPC
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: phrases.Array.size
      value: 17
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Ugh this class is so boring\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[1]'
      value: "I wish I could play Fortnite instead of being stuck at school\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[2]'
      value: "My teacher is acting weird\u2026just staring at the wall."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[3]'
      value: Why do I keep seeing Ribbit around everywhere?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[4]'
      value: "I swear Ribbit was staring right at me\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[5]'
      value: "My friends were acting strange earlier\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[6]'
      value: "The new Mayor is supposed to visit today\u2026BORING!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[7]'
      value: What is that ringing sound? Is anyone hearing that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[8]'
      value: The Principal seemed nervous today.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[9]'
      value: 'Ughhh I have so much homework to do. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[10]'
      value: "My TikTok has been all about aliens lately\u2026why?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[11]'
      value: My dad was watching some video about aliens from Neptune.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[12]'
      value: "Those radios\u2026why do they make my head fuzzy?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[13]'
      value: "I heard the Principal\u2019s ex-wife is with the new Mayor!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[14]'
      value: "I heard the Principal\u2019s ex-wife is with the new Mayor!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[15]'
      value: "I can\u2019t seem to concentrate today\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[16]'
      value: "I didn\u2019t study at all for the quiz\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1095263608110887121, guid: 6806ae61826a40847a348e5556b14719, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'phrases.Array.data[17]'
